					"name": "Subject: Serenity",
					"image": "assets/characters/hwei/hud/icons2d/hweiw.png",
					"tooltip": "Hwei paints visions of serenity that provide utility for himself and allied champions.<br><br><spellName>{{Spell_HweiWQ_Name}}</spellName><br>Hwei launches a current of swift waters in a line that grants allies <speed>@Tooltip_WQMoveSpeed@ Move Speed</speed>.<br><br><spellName>{{Spell_HweiWW_Name}}</spellName><br>Hwei forms a protective pool that grants <shield>@Tooltip_WWShieldAmount@ Shields</shield> over time to allied champions inside reduced by @spell.HweiWW:ToolTipAllyMod*100@% for allies.<br><br><spellName>{{Spell_HweiWE_Name}}</spellName><br>Hwei creates three swirling lights that empower his next three Abilities or Attacks to deal an additional <magicDamage>@Tooltip_WEOnHitDamage@ magic damage</magicDamage> and restore <scaleMana>@Tooltip_WEOnHitManaRestore@ Mana</scaleMana> each.",
